<title>USA: Cephalon Inc Q4 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Cephalon Inc Q4 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>WEST CHESTER, Pa. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended    Year Ended</p>
<p>				December 31,		 December 31,</p>
<p>				1996	 1995	1996	 1995</p>
<p> Revenues		 $9,959     $10,288   $21,366    $46,999</p>
<p>Gain on sale of assets</p>
<p>			     9,845	   ---     9,845	  ---</p>
<p> Loss		    (4,886)    (11,818)  (53,285)   (33,003)</p>
<p> Loss per share	 (0.20)	(0.51)    (2.19)     (1.63)</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>  shares outstanding  24,534	23,401    24,319     20,262</p>
<p>		    (Amounts in Thousands, Except per Share)</p>
<p>NOTE:  The differences in revenues between 1995 and 1996 results from $22.9 million in non-recurring reimbursement payments made in 1995 by Chiron Corp in 1995 to equalize its share of expenses under a collaboration agreement and $5.2 million from Cephalon Clinical Partners LP which concluded the Partnership's funding for the Myotrophin development program.</p>
</text>
